      "id": "claim_067627eef8b64a0391c319685473aa51",
      "statement": "Since M3 the first vertical slice runs end to end: the browser creates a session, a local model streams one opening question token by token over SSE, and the typed answer lands in session.json with a Markdown transcript. It is one round only — no turn loop, question tree, distillation, or idea input yet; since M4 a CI pipeline runs the hermetic tier, and since M5 the interface is bilingual (German/English) with the session carrying its own language.",
